      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this would be really useful when some people have avatar audio volume set way too high compared to everyone else. this would allow us to down the volume of a specific avatar/player wihout having to bring down the global setting , making us unable to hear other avatr audio whose volume are perfectly fine. a sliding bar like the mic level setting would work great",
