  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think it would be great if we could adjust avatar audio level on a per user basis, just like how we can change the volume of users talking, for each individual user.\n\nThis would especially be great for public instances, where we can run into people, who are using 2D audio sources or very big audio ranges.",
